@1 = ~That deal with the dao has been terrible for business. Nearly every product I had is gone. I need corn to make cornstarch, and I need flour and grain, too. Why does misfortune always find me?~
@2 = ~I have some corn. Will you pay 500 gold for it?~
@3 = ~I have some flour. Will you pay 320 gold for it?~
@4 = ~I have some grain. Will you pay 365 gold for it?~
@5 = ~Perhaps things will improve soon.~
